# The maplibre worker is staged from the container's own node_modules by
# scripts/copy-maplibre-worker.mjs during the build. A stale copy staged on the
# host by next dev/build (potentially from a different maplibre-gl version) must
# not leak into the image via COPY . .
public/maplibre
